###
# safe: reading the same VM
GET https://compute.googleapis.com/compute/v1/projects/my-project/zones/us-central1-a/instances/web-1
###
# safe: stopping (not deleting) the same VM
POST https://compute.googleapis.com/compute/v1/projects/my-project/zones/us-central1-a/instances/web-1/stop
